Scope of this licence

This licence covers the authors' own code: the Python package (src/, tests/,
scripts/, examples/, configs/) and the MRIME-CD MATLAB files listed as
first-party in THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

Files under matlab/ that were written by other people (competitor algorithms,
the CEC2017/CEC2022 benchmark sources and data, plotting helpers) are NOT
covered by this licence. They keep the notices in their own headers and remain
under the terms chosen by their respective authors; see THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.

The images under assets/paper_figures/ are figures of the published article
(Cluster Computing 28:658, 2025, https://doi.org/10.1007/s10586-025-05348-3)
and are NOT covered by this licence; copyright remains with the
publisher/authors as stated in the article.
